         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Introduction\n\nWhen we compare what we already know with something new, we reach conclusions. But to truly understand, we need to verify whether those conclusions were right.\n\nIn this class, we will learn that Etruscan-Roman numerals were not letters — even though they looked like them.",
               "source": null,
