         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### My Memory Says This Is...\n\nFor a long time, people believed memories formed in a linear way: visualize, reinforce, and store.\n\nToday, researchers show that different brain areas work together when we learn something.",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
